\title{Squared increments on the circle}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{For the continuous field of \ref{fdip-00BG}, the number
#{\mathbb E\lvert f_x-f_y\rvert^2} depends only on the shorter
arc between #{x} and #{y}. What distance does that number
assign, and how does the distance compare with the arc itself?}
